Package: citesperu
Title: Peruvian Species Checklists from CITES Publications
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Paul E.", "Santos Andrade", , "paulefrens@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6635-0375"))
Description: An R package under development for working with Peruvian fauna
    and flora checklists published by the Ministry of the Environment (MINAM)
    under the Convention on International Trade in Endangered Species of
    Wild Fauna and Flora (CITES). Planned functionality includes reproducible
    data preparation, checklist queries, scientific name matching and
    summaries by appendix and taxonomic group. This initial version contains
    package documentation; datasets and query functions are not yet included.
